@intent The mod's Curios accessories, worn in their Curios slots by a survival player, give what their code promises -- the ring and necklace their justified-defence bonuses, the crown its extra health, the wings survival flight -- and taking each off takes it away again, with no errors from the mod or Curios (TLS-057: from Curios 10, 1.21.4+, the stat bonuses never apply)
@continue-on-fail
# Only ids every version shares: the mod's own attributes, the abilities NBT and health. Vanilla attribute ids
# changed at 1.21.2 (generic.max_health -> max_health), and a script cannot branch on the version.
# /curios replace refuses every slot on Curios 10-14 (1.21.4..1.21.11: its slot list is filled before the slots load),
# so there those steps fail at the command, not at the check.
@step arena
# a command that changes nothing fails: go through creative so survival is a change
gamemode creative
gamemode survival
time set day
execute if entity @e[type=!minecraft:player] run kill @e[type=!minecraft:player]
# an attribute value is read into a score (x100, x10000 for the 0.01-scale recovery speed, so fractional modifiers count): before, worn, and after
scoreboard objectives add pt_base dummy
scoreboard objectives add pt_now dummy
scoreboard objectives add pt_hp health

@step ring: the dragon crystal ring adds 6 max justified defence while worn
execute store result score @s pt_base run attribute @s the_last_sword:max_justified_defence get 100
curios replace ring 0 @s with the_last_sword:dragon_crystal_ring
@wait 1s
execute store result score @s pt_now run attribute @s the_last_sword:max_justified_defence get 100
@assert execute if score @s pt_now > @s pt_base
curios clear @s ring
@wait 1s
execute store result score @s pt_now run attribute @s the_last_sword:max_justified_defence get 100
@assert execute if score @s pt_now = @s pt_base

@step necklace: the dragon crystal necklace raises justified defence recovery speed while worn
execute store result score @s pt_base run attribute @s the_last_sword:justified_defence_recovery_speed get 10000
curios replace necklace 0 @s with the_last_sword:dragon_crystal_necklace
@wait 1s
execute store result score @s pt_now run attribute @s the_last_sword:justified_defence_recovery_speed get 10000
@assert execute if score @s pt_now > @s pt_base
curios clear @s necklace
@wait 1s
execute store result score @s pt_now run attribute @s the_last_sword:justified_defence_recovery_speed get 10000
@assert execute if score @s pt_now = @s pt_base

@step crown: the dragon crystal crown's +200 max health lets the player heal above 20
curios replace head 0 @s with the_last_sword:dragon_crystal_crown
@wait 1s
effect give @s minecraft:instant_health 1 20 true
@wait 1s
@assert execute if score @s pt_hp matches 40..
@shot crowned
curios clear @s head
@wait 1s
@assert execute if score @s pt_hp matches ..20

@step wings: Wings That Cover the World let a survival player fly while worn, and not after
curios replace back 0 @s with the_last_sword:wings_that_cover_the_world
# curioTick grants mayfly on the next tick it runs
@wait 2s
@assert execute if entity @s[nbt={abilities:{mayfly:1b}}]
curios clear @s back
@wait 2s
@assert execute if entity @s[nbt={abilities:{mayfly:0b}}]
